[{"text":"ExcludeMasses is an option of Apart2. It allows to specify masses w.r.t which partial fraction decomposition should not be performed, e.g. ExcludeMasses->{m1,m2,3}.","anchor":"excludemasses"},{"text":"Overview, Apart2.","anchor":"see-also","section":"See also"},{"text":"Apart2[FAD[k, {k, m1}, {k, m2}]] // Expand","anchor":"cb1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\frac{1}{\\text{m1}^2 \\left(\\text{m1}^2-\\text{m2}^2\\right) \\left(k^2-\\text{m1}^2\\right)}-\\frac{1}{\\text{m1}^2 \\left(\\text{m1}^2-\\text{m2}^2\\right) \\left(k^2-\\text{m2}^2\\right)}-\\frac{1}{\\text{m1}^2 \\;\\text{m2}^2 \\left(k^2-\\text{m2}^2\\right)}+\\frac{1}{k^2 \\;\\text{m1}^2 \\;\\text{m2}^2}\\]","anchor":"cb1-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Apart2[FAD[k, {k, m1}, {k, m2}], ExcludeMasses -> m2] // Expand","anchor":"cb2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\frac{1}{\\text{m1}^2 \\left(k^2-\\text{m1}^2\\right).\\left(k^2-\\text{m2}^2\\right)}-\\frac{1}{\\text{m1}^2 k^2.\\left(k^2-\\text{m2}^2\\right)}\\]","anchor":"cb2-1","section":"Examples"}]